# Claude Code workspace permissions. MUST stay ignored: autopilot*.ps1's killed-run guard
# runs `git stash push -u`, which sweeps untracked files — and on 2026-08-02 it swept
# .claude/settings.json itself three times, killing every run after it (no syntax gate, no
# screenshot harness, no commit path). `-u` does NOT touch ignored files, so this line is the
# fix. See AUTOPILOT_BLOCKED_2026-08-02.md.
.claude/

# wrangler local cache
.wrangler/
.playwright-cli/
_autopilot.log
_autopilot_authwarn
